  {
   "id": 9028576247868,
   "title": "Ethiopia Ayla Bombe Single Origin Espresso",
   "handle": "ethiopia-ayla-bombe",
   "body_html": "<p>Ayla Bombe brings together coffees from smallholder farmers surrounding the Ayla washing station in Ethiopia's Sidama region. As espresso, the sweetness and complexity of coffees from this region really shine, with notes of ripe stone fruit and fresh lime zest.</p>\n<p><span>Shot</span><span> </span><span>Specs</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>18g</span><span> </span><span>in</span><span> </span><span>/</span><span> </span><span>30-34</span><span> </span><span>seconds</span><span> </span><span>/</span><span> </span><span>47-50g</span><span> </span><span>out</span></p>",
