   "title": "Flair 58+2",
   "handle": "flair-58-2",
   "body_html": "The Flair 58+2 is a versatile, manual espresso machine that's both simple and effective. It is designed to pull both traditional and modern style espressos, giving you a tactile experience by letting you feel the extraction process. A unique feature is its electronically heated open reservoir, which can hold 90-100 ml of liquid and allows for varying water profiles. The machine uses a professional-grade 58mm portafilter and is designed with stylish walnut accents. The +2 model has been updated with an embedded controller, streamlined wiring, and a smaller power supply.",
